## ADDITIONAL ROBUSTNESS FIX

  lib/hooks.ts — the shared reveal sweep now runs synchronously when
  `document.visibilityState !== 'visible'`. requestAnimationFrame callbacks are
  frozen in a hidden tab, so an rAF-only sweep left content unrevealed in
  background tabs and in offscreen/headless rendering. Caught in testing: four
  sections scrolled fully past while hidden and none had revealed.

